From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:28:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the Final Settlement module (end of service and leave
 encashment)

Replaces the four Final Settlement design previews with working screens:
settlements list with key figures, a new-settlement form, the settlement
page (every figure with how it was calculated, waivable and hand-added
lines, summary, approval route, history), a printable bilingual EN/AR
statement, and leave encashment without exit.

Database (run 39, 40, re-run 35, then 41):
- 39: FinalSettlements / Lines / History tables, LEAVE_ENC pay item
  type, PAYROLL_FS_* permissions
- 40: calculation (pending salary by calendar days, unpaid pay items,
  leave encashment, indemnity from the rule set in force with cap and
  separation-type factor, loan balances, PIFSS on pending salary,
  salary paid after the last day) and the Draft > HR > Finance >
  Approved > Paid workflow with segregation of duties
- 35: the payroll engine leaves out an employee whose settlement pays
  the last salary; submit/approve refuse while a live payroll still
  includes them, and every approval re-checks the amount
- 41: 302 English + Arabic labels and procedure messages

Final approval marks the employee Resigned/Terminated and ends the
recovered loans and paid pay items; an approved leave encashment
becomes a one-time earning in the chosen payroll month.

